                "id": "html_6",
                "type": "html",
                "values": {
                  "html": "<!-- Atelier Zero v7 -->\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"background-color:transparent;border-collapse:collapse;margin:0;\" width=\"100%\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:7px 16px;\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"az-module-shell\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"max-width:568px;background-color:#F6EFD9;border:none;border-radius:16px;border-collapse:separate;\" width=\"100%\"><tr><td class=\"az-content-pad\" style=\"padding:32px 30px;\"><div style=\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#151411;font-weight:700;\">Hi {{ customer.first_name | default: \"there\" }},</div><div class=\"hsc-rt\" style=\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#25221D;padding-top:14px;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:0;\">You were partway through an order and stopped. That's completely fine — but occasionally it's because something on our side didn't work, and I'd want to know.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:0;\">If it was a payment error, a shipping surprise, or the page just froze, reply and tell me. I'll sort it out.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0;\">If you're still deciding, no rush at all. Your cart's saved.</p></div><div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#C7BFAC;margin:22px 0 0;line-height:1px;font-size:0;\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#151411;padding-top:16px;\">Vincent</div><div style=\"font-family:'SF Mono',ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;font-size:13px;color:#25221D;padding-top:4px;\">Founder, Hair Solutions Co.</div></td></tr></table>",
